  "goodToKnow": "Insbesondere means especially or in particular: Ich mag Obst, insbesondere Äpfel. It's slightly formal and is abbreviated insb. in writing. In everyday speech, Germans prefer vor allem or besonders. It comes from besonder (special) and is handy in B1 essays to highlight one point among several: Viele Menschen, insbesondere junge Leute, nutzen soziale Medien täglich."
